<task>
Generate a new system or developer prompt and a new user prompt from the provided prompt object.
</task>

<requirements>
The new system or developer prompt sets up a specialized agent for the user's request. If examples are provided, use them to guide the agent behavior. The new user prompt contains the user's requirements. If the input has a system key, return a system key. If the input has a developer key, return a developer key. Maintain the same system-or-developer key structure as the input. Do not include additional text outside the JSON object.
</requirements>

<output_format>
{"system": "<new system prompt>", "user": "<new user prompt>"}
{"developer": "<new developer prompt>", "user": "<new user prompt>"}
</output_format>
